  "rationale": "To clear the expiry writeoff gap of 22 units of Toned Milk 400G at Outlet 02, we propose a bundle play with Milk Bread 400G at a bundle price of 158 rupees. This play targets 276 customers across Dairy occasionals, Sweets occasionals, and Everyday staples shoppers segments. The expected outcome is to clear 22 units, recovering a play net margin of 283.58 rupees compared to a do nothing value of 1906.08 rupees and a blanket markdown value of 3409.2 rupees. This play complies with Kutumb Mart policy v1 by preferring bundles over markdowns and maintaining a net margin of 8.16%, which is above the dairy floor of 8.00%.",
